{'symbol': 'TGT', 'date': '2022-01-13 06:30:00', 'title': 'TARGET CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, JAN. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TARGET CORPORATION (NYSE:TGT) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 90 CENTS PER COMMON SHARE.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MARCH 10, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS FEBRUARY 16, 2022.'}